Full text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

2. WHAT IS NOT LICENSED
-----------------------

The source code of minikit-ai is NOT published in this repository and is NOT
covered by any open-source licence. It is proprietary.

The compiled program (`minikit-ai.exe` and the installer
`minikit-ai-<version>-setup.exe`, distributed through Releases) is also
proprietary and is provided to you as a binary only.

You may:

  - download, install and use it, on any number of computers you own or are
    authorised to administer
  - use it for any purpose, including commercial work
  - keep using it forever, offline, with no telemetry and no account

You may NOT:

  - copy, publish or redistribute the binaries, in whole or in part, modified
    or unmodified, except by linking to the official Releases page
  - decompile, disassemble, unpack or otherwise attempt to recover the source
    code or the encrypted assets from the binaries, except to the extent that
    such restriction is unenforceable under the law that applies to you
  - remove or obscure the authorship notices

3. NO WARRANTY
-------------

The program is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind, express or
implied, including but not limited to the warranties of merchantability,
