4. YOUR DATA
------------

The program is designed so that it cannot transmit your documents anywhere.
That is a technical property of how it is built, described in SECURITY.md and
in the README. It is not a contractual promise, and it is not a substitute for
your own judgement about the sensitivity of your files.

5. REPORTING PROBLEMS
---------------------

Security issues: see SECURITY.md.
Other problems: open an issue on the project page.
